Important: I don not want to include the Domain layer and Usecases unless instructed otherwise
Important: I want the top level packaging to be feature based. First articles and then the sources.

* UI Layer 
- Single Activity with Composables
- Navigation Components

* Presentation Layer
- Viewmodels
- UI State classes
- Presentation models eg. Article

* Data Layer
- Repository Implementation 
- Remote data sources (API)
- Data Models eg. ArticleData
- No Database or local storage need
- Repository pattern, no interface only repository implementation, single source of true, easy to switch data sources

* MVVM Pattern
- Viewmodels handle UI logic and UI state
- Composables are only responsible for UI
- State classes represent UI State

* Dependency Injection
- Wew ill use Hilt for Dependency Injection

* Coroutines & State Flow
- Coroutines for asynchronous operations
- Handles API calls and data processing
- State flow between view model and UI for manage UI state updates

* Key concepts
- Clean Architecture
- Important: Simplicity
- Separation of concerns
- Testability
- Maintainability
- I don’t want you to create any bases classes
